---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Services – B&G Engineering"
  description="Mechanical design, fixtures, jigs, DFM support, prototyping and 3D printing for manufacturing projects."
>
  <section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1>Mechanical design support for manufacturing projects.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      External engineering capacity for special-purpose machines, fixtures,
      jigs, DFM tasks, prototypes and manufacturing-focused CAD documentation.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Mechanical design support</h2>
    <p>
      CAD modelling, assemblies, manufacturing drawings and technical documentation
      for manufacturing, automation and prototyping projects.
    </p>

    <h2>Fixtures, jigs and tooling</h2>
    <p>
      Design of assembly, positioning, inspection and production-support fixtures
      for real manufacturing environments, with attention to usability and repeatability.
    </p>

    <h2>DFM / DFA support</h2>
    <p>
      Practical design review focused on manufacturability, assembly,
      maintenance access, tool access and production reliability.
    </p>

    <h2>Prototyping and 3D printing</h2>
    <p>
      3D-printing-supported prototypes, test parts, fixture components,
      checking aids and small-batch technical parts.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-box">
    <h2>Have a specific task?</h2>
    <p>
      A short project description is usually enough to identify the required
      design support, documentation or prototyping step.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/en/contact/">Contact</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
